    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find  all the mines and win Game with 4 to 8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 12 landmines are located, with six additional landmines distributed to the 12 already allocated positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > However, there is a Saboteur among you who wants you to step on a landmine... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night comes for every 8th action. And at the end of the night, you vote to decide one player that you want  out of the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day and night, you can also use your job skills to take the game easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519470/extras/266ff40ac13119359d16d3d143ea7dd5.avif?t=1741079551\" width=600 height=124 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CITIZEN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We need to find all the landmines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use scanners on ? tiles, and exchange information with other citizens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Click on the ? tile to record which player said which number. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your abilities to help you find all the landmines. You can also use them for your own fun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click to leave a marker and record the location of the landmine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If all remaining citizens use 12 markers in the same location, dig all the remaining land and end the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose carefully who to trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519470/extras/79b32756775b484846980d88867c105a.avif?t=1741079551\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SABOTEUR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can see the location and number of landmines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Act to make yourself look like a citizen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your ability to cause confusion to citizens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You win if you let only one of citizens step on a landmine. Or you can disturb them to self-destruct.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find  all the mines and win Game with 4 to 8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 12 landmines are located, with six additional landmines distributed to the 12 already allocated positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > However, there is a Saboteur among you who wants you to step on a landmine... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night comes for every 8th action. And at the end of the night, you vote to decide one player that you want  out of the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day and night, you can also use your job skills to take the game easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519470/extras/266ff40ac13119359d16d3d143ea7dd5.avif?t=1741079551\" width=600 height=124 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CITIZEN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We need to find all the landmines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use scanners on ? tiles, and exchange information with other citizens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Click on the ? tile to record which player said which number. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your abilities to help you find all the landmines. You can also use them for your own fun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click to leave a marker and record the location of the landmine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If all remaining citizens use 12 markers in the same location, dig all the remaining land and end the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose carefully who to trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519470/extras/79b32756775b484846980d88867c105a.avif?t=1741079551\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SABOTEUR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can see the location and number of landmines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Act to make yourself look like a citizen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your ability to cause confusion to citizens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You win if you let only one of citizens step on a landmine. Or you can disturb them to self-destruct.</p>",
    "short_description": "Land Mine Land is a Minesweeper Game that 4 to 8 people can enjoy.Get a random job and use your job-specific abilities to win!",
